    <briefdescription>
<para>This assigns and keeps a per-bb relative ordering of load/store instructions in the block that directly load or store an alloca. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This functionality is important because it avoids scanning large basic blocks multiple times when promoting many allocas in the same block. </para>
